WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.680
SCP-682 Vs SCP-2521. An unspeakably cruel&nbsp;
and violent reptile Vs a monster that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.120
literally unspeakable. Who won? Let’s find out.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:16.080
The Foundation used a laser cutting tool&nbsp;
to etch information about SCP-2521 into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:23.360
the skin of SCP-682’s side, in the hopes that&nbsp;
the monster would turn up and steal SCP-682.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:29.360
However, it didn’t work out that way. Instead, it&nbsp;
just appeared and tore the skin off of 682’s side&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:34.960
before demanifesting. 682 regenerated the&nbsp;
missing skin later. Better luck next time.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.880
Oh, come on! Every time!

